#: project/data/lines/all_intact.json
msgid "Everything arrived in one piece. I am as surprised as you are."
msgstr "全部完好送達。我跟你一樣驚訝。"

#: project/data/lines/all_intact.json
msgid "Zero damage. Write it down. It will not happen again."
msgstr "零損傷。記下來，不會有第二次了。"

#: project/data/lines/all_intact.json
msgid "A perfect delivery. The clients will think we cheated."
msgstr "完美交貨。客戶會以為我們作弊。"

#: project/data/lines/all_intact.json
msgid "Not a scratch. I will take most of the credit."
msgstr "一點刮痕都沒有。功勞大部分算我的。"

#: project/data/lines/break.json
msgid "Something broke. I heard it. I chose not to look."
msgstr "有東西碎了。我聽到了，但我選擇不看。"

#: project/data/lines/break.json
msgid "We are now in the gravel business, apparently."
msgstr "看來我們現在改做碎石生意了。"

#: project/data/lines/break.json
msgid "That was fragile. It is now very fragile. In many pieces."
msgstr "它原本很易碎。現在非常易碎，碎成很多片。"

#: project/data/lines/break.json
msgid "Good news: the box is lighter. Bad news: it is the shards."
msgstr "好消息：箱子變輕了。壞消息：裡面只剩碎片。"

#: project/data/lines/chain.json
msgid "That was a chain reaction. Very pretty. Very expensive."
msgstr "剛剛是連鎖反應。很漂亮，也很貴。"

#: project/data/lines/chain.json
msgid "Explosion, then explosion, then me, screaming quietly."
msgstr "爆炸，接著爆炸，接著是我在安靜地尖叫。"

#: project/data/lines/chain.json
msgid "I counted the blasts. Then I stopped counting. Then I cried in binary."
msgstr "我數了爆炸次數。後來不數了。再後來我用二進位哭了。"

#: project/data/lines/chain.json
msgid "Fireworks! Nobody ordered fireworks. We delivered them anyway."
msgstr "煙火！沒人訂煙火，但我們還是送到了。"

#: project/data/lines/empty.json
msgid "We flew with nothing. Very safe. Very poor."
msgstr "我們空著飛。很安全，也很窮。"

#: project/data/lines/empty.json
msgid "An empty hold. Zero risk, zero pay. Bold strategy."
msgstr "貨艙空空。零風險，零收入。大膽的策略。"

#: project/data/lines/empty.json
msgid "I enjoyed that quiet jump. The bank did not."
msgstr "我很享受這趟安靜的跳躍。銀行不這麼想。"

#: project/data/lines/empty.json
msgid "No cargo, no damage, no credits. Perfect balance."
msgstr "沒貨、沒損傷、沒收入。完美的平衡。"

#: project/data/lines/explosion.json
msgid "One explosion. Small. Mostly. Please stop the fire."
msgstr "一次爆炸。小小的，大致上。請把火滅掉。"

#: project/data/lines/explosion.json
msgid "We had a Volatile event. The Volatile won."
msgstr "剛剛發生了爆裂物事件。爆裂物贏了。"

#: project/data/lines/explosion.json
msgid "The hold is a little roomier now. You are welcome, I guess."
msgstr "貨艙現在寬敞一點了。不客氣，大概吧。"

#: project/data/lines/explosion.json
msgid "Boom. I logged it as 'unscheduled cargo release'."
msgstr "轟。我把它記成「非預定貨物釋放」。"

#: project/data/lines/hazard.json
msgid "Turbulence ahead. I suggest you pack like you mean it."
msgstr "前方有亂流。建議你認真打包。"

#: project/data/lines/hazard.json
msgid "Gravity storm on the route. Your cargo will dance. Badly."
msgstr "航線上有重力風暴。你的貨會跳舞，跳得很爛。"

#: project/data/lines/hazard.json
msgid "Asteroid field. I will dodge. Your boxes will not."
msgstr "小行星帶。我會閃開，你的箱子不會。"

#: project/data/lines/hazard.json
msgid "The jump is rough today. As every day. Pack tight."
msgstr "今天的跳躍很顛簸。跟每天一樣。塞緊一點。"

#: project/data/lines/hazard.json
msgid "Navigation says: hold on. Cargo says nothing. Cargo never listens."
msgstr "導航說：抓穩。貨物什麼都沒說。貨物從來不聽話。"

#: project/data/lines/leak.json
msgid "Something leaked. Something else sparked. Do not lick the floor."
msgstr "有東西漏了，又有東西冒火花。不要舔地板。"

#: project/data/lines/leak.json
msgid "The coolant is out. The electronics are also out. Permanently."
msgstr "冷卻液沒了。電子零件也沒了，永遠的。"

#: project/data/lines/leak.json
msgid "Fluid plus circuits. A classic recipe for scrap."
msgstr "液體加電路，經典的廢鐵食譜。"

#: project/data/lines/leak.json
msgid "We have a leak. I recommend boots. And new circuits."
msgstr "漏水了。建議穿雨鞋，再換新電路。"

#: project/data/lines/lose.json
msgid "No credits for the toll. We live here now."
msgstr "付不出通行費。我們以後就住這裡了。"

#: project/data/lines/lose.json
msgid "The gate stays closed. So does our business."
msgstr "閘門不開。我們的生意也關門了。"

#: project/data/lines/lose.json
msgid "Out of credits. I will start selling your chair."
msgstr "沒錢了。我要開始賣你的椅子了。"

#: project/data/lines/lose.json
msgid "Run over. Next time, maybe fewer explosions."
msgstr "航程結束。下次也許少炸一點。"

#: project/data/lines/spoil.json
msgid "The food went bad. The smell is now a crew member."
msgstr "食物壞了。那股味道現在是船員了。"

#: project/data/lines/spoil.json
msgid "Cold chain broken. So is my will to breathe."
msgstr "冷藏鏈斷了。我呼吸的意願也斷了。"

#: project/data/lines/spoil.json
msgid "Something in the hold is growing. It is not the profit."
msgstr "貨艙裡有東西在長大。不是利潤。"

#: project/data/lines/spoil.json
msgid "A Cooler would have helped. A nose plug would help now."
msgstr "有冷藏機就好了。現在有鼻塞也好。"

#: project/data/lines/toll.json
msgid "Toll gate. The sector wants its credits. All of them, if it can."
msgstr "收費站。星區要收錢，能收多少就收多少。"

#: project/data/lines/toll.json
msgid "Pay up, or we sleep out here with the space dust."
msgstr "付錢，不然我們就跟太空塵埃一起睡外面。"

#: project/data/lines/toll.json
msgid "Toll time. Please tell me we have the credits."
msgstr "繳費時間。拜託告訴我錢夠。"

#: project/data/lines/toll.json
msgid "The gate is open. Our wallet is about to be too."
msgstr "閘門開了。我們的錢包也快被打開了。"

#: project/data/lines/win.json
msgid "We made it. All three sectors. I am framing this log."
msgstr "我們辦到了，三個星區全部通過。我要把這份紀錄裱框。"

#: project/data/lines/win.json
msgid "Final toll paid. You are a real freight pilot now. Almost."
msgstr "最後的通行費付清了。你現在是真正的貨運駕駛了。差不多啦。"

#: project/data/lines/win.json
msgid "Route complete. The cargo survived. Mostly. Good work."
msgstr "航程完成。貨物活下來了，大部分。幹得好。"

#: project/data/lines/win.json
msgid "We won. I will tell the other ships. They will not believe me."
msgstr "我們贏了。我會告訴其他飛船，它們不會相信的。"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "All Intact"
msgstr "全部完好"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Deliver each piece."
msgstr "每件貨物都要送達。"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Keep Apart"
msgstr "保持距離"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "No piece arrives next to {trait} cargo."
msgstr "抵達時沒有任何一件緊鄰{trait}貨物。"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Zone"
msgstr "指定區域"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Each piece arrives in the {size} lines at the {side}."
msgstr "每件貨物抵達時都在{side} {size} 排之內。"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Down"
msgstr "下"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Up"
msgstr "上"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Freight"
msgstr "貨物"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Kit"
msgstr "裝備"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Scrap"
msgstr "廢鐵"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "bottom"
msgstr "最下方"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "left"
msgstr "最左邊"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "right"
msgstr "最右邊"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "top"
msgstr "最上方"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Battery"
msgstr "電池"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Powers each Shield next to it."
msgstr "為相鄰的護盾供電。"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Cooler"
msgstr "冷藏"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Keeps each Perishable cargo next to it fresh."
msgstr "讓相鄰的生鮮貨物保持新鮮。"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Cushion"
msgstr "緩衝"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Each hit on it or by it has a force of 0."
msgstr "撞到它或被它撞到時，撞擊力為 0。"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Electronic"
msgstr "電子"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Shorts when a Fluid cargo next to it leaks."
msgstr "相鄰的流體外漏時會短路。"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Fluid"
msgstr "流體"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Leaks at a hit with a force of {limit} or more. The leak shorts each Electronic cargo next to it."
msgstr "受到撞擊力 {limit} 以上的撞擊時外漏，讓相鄰的電子貨物短路。"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Fragile"
msgstr "易碎"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Breaks at a hit with a force of {limit} or more."
msgstr "受到撞擊力 {limit} 以上的撞擊時碎裂。"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Perishable"
msgstr "生鮮"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Spoils at the arrival if it is not next to a Cooler."
msgstr "抵達時如果沒有緊鄰冷藏機就會腐爛。"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Sensor"
msgstr "感測器"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "At the station, it shows the direction of the fork step."
msgstr "在太空站時，能看出二選一位移的實際方向。"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Shield"
msgstr "護盾"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "With power, it protects each cargo next to it from one reaction in each jump."
msgstr "有電力時，每次跳躍能替相鄰的貨物擋下一次反應。"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Thruster"
msgstr "推進器"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Slides 1 cell at most in each shift step."
msgstr "每段位移最多只滑動 1 格。"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Volatile"
msgstr "爆裂物"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Explodes at a hit with a force of {limit} or more. The explosion breaks the cargo around it."
msgstr "受到撞擊力 {limit} 以上的撞擊時爆炸，炸壞周圍的貨物。"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Heavy"
msgstr "重"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Light"
msgstr "輕"

#: project/data/terms.json
msgid "Standard"
msgstr "中"
